  "body": "A home that combines generous space, practical design and a relaxed coastal lifestyle can make everyday living that much easier. Set on approximately 805sqm of freehold land with a 176sqm floor area, this property offers 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, open-plan living and a spacious outdoor deck. Built by Signature Homes, with building guarantees including a 2-year maintenance guarantee, it brings together comfortable family living and added peace of mind in the popular coastal community of Stanmore Bay.\r\n\r\nThe main living level has been designed around comfort and connection. An open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming space for everyday family life, whether it is sharing meals, entertaining friends or simply relaxing after a busy day. The layout allows each area to flow naturally into the next, offering a practical setting for both daily routines and special occasions.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is well equipped with a rangehood, cooktop, oven, dishwasher and waste disposal unit, making meal preparation and clean-up straightforward. Doors from the living and dining areas open onto a generous deck, extending the living space outdoors. The living area also enjoys a pleasant green outlook, bringing a refreshing touch of nature into the everyday living space. Whether it is enjoying a morning coffee, hosting weekend barbecues or spending time with family and friends, this outdoor area offers plenty of opportunities to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms are arranged across the main living level, providing comfortable accommodation for the whole family. The master bedroom features a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite, creating a separate space to retreat at the end of the day. The remaining three bedrooms are served by a family bathroom, offering flexibility for children, guests or those needing a home office. A heat pump provides additional comfort throughout the changing seasons.\r\n\r\nPracticality continues downstairs, where a single garage includes a convenient laundry nook, keeping everyday household tasks neatly organised. Two additional parking spaces at the front of the property provide extra convenience for households with multiple vehicles or visiting guests. The approximately 805sqm freehold section includes sloping outdoor areas, offering additional space beyond the home's indoor living areas.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding location adds another layer of appeal. Situated in the sought-after coastal community of Stanmore Bay, the property is within easy reach of local beaches, parks, schools and everyday amenities. Stanmore Bay Shopping Centre and nearby cafés provide convenient options for shopping and dining, while Silverdale offers a wider range of retail and recreational facilities just a short drive away. Convenient motorway connections also make commuting and exploring the wider Auckland region straightforward.\r\n\r\nCombining generous freehold land, a practical family layout and inviting indoor-outdoor living, this property offers a comfortable setting for a variety of lifestyles. Whether you are looking for room for a growing family, space to entertain or a home close to the coast, 11 Ti Tree Lane is well worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
